{"id": "EUVD-2026-103622", "enisaUuid": "9d51ca84-595a-3c67-ba7e-46559683ec84", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnfc: llcp: fix WKS SAP hijacking via prefix match in nfc_llcp_wks_sap()\n\nnfc_llcp_wks_sap() compares only service_name_len bytes, so a short\nservice_name like \"u\" matches longer WKS strings like \"urn:nfc:sn:snep\".\nFix by requiring exact length match before strncmp().", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:18:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:22:02", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0c83a8a45fed256ccc5fe7160b436b671fc79fb8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aa555ed5ed0d15efbaf27e0e9f152a6df715278a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32b5f0b338bf59391a1cff9a6190a72c4d2c1ba8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6fad2c34d451d11a9f3f946cae1105fee91d96b8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bf41af8f910cbb5d776a1dfa0671d31a7e262e28", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f234197f3bda3aea5d4b1e591d6bcb3660a8b3fc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a0412745c86acd089c6460da715ab966b1615e7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/408cff6bd60636df201274d320edfdfde9ed41db"], "aliases": ["GHSA-5pvx-6xr7-wr9x", "CVE-2026-98577"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "302e1a64-73b2-3401-a36c-dd154f07c448", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.10.271"}, {"id": "3af7d14d-9742-3a6d-a0c3-99e39b0b745f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "4c76d002-e19a-3613-843e-028161de8de2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d646960f7986fefb460a2b062d5ccc8ccfeacc3a <408cff6bd60636df201274d320edfdfde9ed41db"}, {"id": "4f1cc64f-462a-3520-9b2c-05973c7b54e4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d646960f7986fefb460a2b062d5ccc8ccfeacc3a <aa555ed5ed0d15efbaf27e0e9f152a6df715278a"}, {"id": "55d64b0a-c